interfaceRows.output:
- both old_email_pow+new_email_pow (session required): 200 {old_email_subject,new_email_subject}; 400 "old_email_pow and new_email_pow must both be provided" if exactly one
- none (valid session): deregister-request branch → 200 {email_subject}
- none (no/invalid session): email-auth branch → 200 {email_subject}
- missing pow: 400 "pow is required"
errors: 400 email domain not allowed / challenge not issued, expired, or already used / PoW verification failed / email already sent recently / email does not match your account; 401 invalid session; 500 failed to send email

